\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a618"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a619", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ac"], "topics": ["60e2fb5766f9ce3f243b4f3c"], "concepts": ["60e40fd4f1ef260f84ed1e43"], "question": {"text": "The number of spectral lines emitted by atomic hydrogen that is in the $4^{\\text {th }}$ energy level, is"}, "options": [{"id": "9441de", "text": "3", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a61a"}, {"id": "721971", "text": "1", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a61b"}, {"id": "ea8007", "text": "6", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a61c"}, {"id": "c29782", "text": "0", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a61d"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a61e", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ac"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4766"], "concepts": ["6162fb5b6ed13040ec84df6b"], "question": {"text": "In a hydrogen like atom, when an electron jumps from the M-shell to the L-shell, the wavelength of emitted radiation is $L$. If an electron jumps from $\\mathrm{N}$ -shell to the $\\mathrm{L}$ -shell, the wavelength of emitted radiation will be:"}, "options": [{"id": "9faea2", "text": "$\\frac{27}{20} \\lambda$", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a61f"}, {"id": "5e8379", "text": "$\\frac{16}{25} \\lambda$", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a620"}, {"id": "9c84cf", "text": "$\\frac{25}{16} \\lambda$", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a621"}, {"id": "f0b345", "text": "$\\frac{20}{27} \\lambda$", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a622"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f2d2ee0e063d924a623", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60d2d1d2185d7a32fa3205ac"], "topics": ["60e2fb5766f9ce3f243b4f3c"], "concepts": ["6117b5e3478ae845c43c5de3"], "question": {"text": "The wavelength of the photon emitted by a hydrogen